    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UFOs On Stream is a physics based UFO survival game. Each UFO flies down an obstacle course while bouncing off opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitch Integration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers\u00a0join matches by typing !join in your twitch chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom colored in game names that match chat usernames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time physics interactions between all\u00a0players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 distinct arenas with unique\u00a0hazards and obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last UFO standing wins!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UFOs On Stream is a physics based UFO survival game. Each UFO flies down an obstacle course while bouncing off opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitch Integration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers\u00a0join matches by typing !join in your twitch chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom colored in game names that match chat usernames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time physics interactions between all\u00a0players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 distinct arenas with unique\u00a0hazards and obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last UFO standing wins!</p></li></ul>",
